========================================================================
METHOD
========================================================================

1. Static inventory: grants `g_tok_http/tcp/udp/bind` already minted in `chs_rt_sys.c`; requires declared in `chs_rt.h` but missing bodies; netfloor/tls/fetch all `require_net`.
2. Small runtime fix (OWN scope): implement four requires (exact granular **OR** `g_tok_net`); rewire ops.
3. C-host probe `/tmp/cap_g1_rt_probe2.c` linked against `runtime/chs_rt.c` — fork-per-case, expect `ERR\tcap` + non-zero for deny, exit 0 for require-pass (effect may still Err).
4. Product-host emit-c via `oodac/oodac`: NetCap fetch, HttpCap fetch, TcpCap-for-fetch (wrong).
5. Host-patch residual prove: inject `long long http = oo_cap_grant_http()` into emitted C → require pass.

No check-layer edit. No push.

